OL,3,GNEWSAChemicals suspected as dead fish
OL,4,Aspotted in stream
OL,5,
OL,6,FWater quality campaigners have said
OL,7,Fthey suspect a chemical spill after
OL,8,Fdead fish were reported in a stream.
OL,10,FResidents in Bransgore, Hampshire,
OL,11,Freported blue-grey coloured water in
OL,12,FSopley Brook on Tuesday.
OL,14,FNew Forest Water Watch, a volunteer
OL,15,Fgroup that carries out water testing,
OL,16,Fsaid it believed the pollution was
OL,17,Fchemical-related, rather than sewage or
OL,18,Foil.
OL,20,FThe Environment Agency confirmed it was
OL,21,Finvestigating and said officers had
OL,22,Ftaken samples for testing.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
